// Janitor's Orbit

@0 = ~Swirling Orb~
@1 = ~Janitor's Orbit~

@10 = ~This fist-sized item consists of a dark orb that is surrounded by a swirling mass of unidentifiable objects. Just looking at it makes you dizzy.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2~
@11 = ~The Janitor's Orbit is not just a simple container. It is literally a miniature-sized pocket plane of spherical shape, held in place by a magical force field.

At closer inspection you can make out a dozen tiny iron keys that slowly orbit a fist-sized sphere of polished obsidian, never touching it. New keys added to the collection vanish into the orbit and become one with the plane. When you need one, it drifts into your hand.

Rumors claim the sphere is a fragment of a dead demiplane where every lock once existed simultaneously.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2~
